  "details": "After the new UI update, some of the status icons on the website have a gray border that looks like the Offline icon, but when the user is online and in world. Hovering over the icon has the correct tooltip \"Ask Me - In World\" etc. \n\nSeems to affect the following from what I can see on my friends list:\n\n- \"Ask Me - In World\"\n\n- \"Do Not Disturb - In World\"\n\n- \"Join Me - Active On Website\" (maybe? I feel like it should be blue not gray?)",
